cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the measurements in it, please cite the paper below."
title: "Label-Free or Zero-Shot? The Transductive Dose of an AI-Music Detector, and a Detector Without One"
abstract: >-
  Code, confound-gate battery and full provenance record for a study of
  label-free AI-generated-music detection. Measures the transductive dose a
  published dictionary-based detector pays, and proposes a training-free,
  dictionary-free comb detector calibrated against a deterministic harmonic
  null.
type: software
